WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.071 --> 00:00:04.532
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:10.234
What do they see?

3
00:00:10.235 --> 00:00:16.401
A nest fell from a tree.

4
00:00:16.402 --> 00:00:22.539
There's a baby bird inside!

5
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:31.725
Blobs, what will you do?

6
00:00:31.726 --> 00:00:55.548
They teach the bird to walk.

7
00:00:55.549 --> 00:01:16.310
They teach the bird to dance.

8
00:01:16.311 --> 00:01:42.252
They teach the bird to sing.

9
00:01:42.253 --> 00:01:58.718
They teach the bird to fly.

10
00:01:58.719 --> 00:02:10.139
They teach the bird to sleep.

11
00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:19.537
They put the nest back.

12
00:02:19.538 --> 00:02:31.105
Good job, blobs!

13
00:02:31.106 --> 00:02:34.733
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:34.734 --> 00:02:37.939
Good-bye!

